ied healthcare professional or registered dietitian before making significant changes to your diet, especially if you have a diagnosed medical condition or are on medication."]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"2. Eligibility"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"You must be at least 18 years of age to create an account and use MealCoreAI. By using the Service, you represent that you are 18 or older and have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"3. Account Registration"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"To access personalised features, you must create an account. You agree to:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Provide accurate, current, and complete information during registration."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Keep your login credentials confidential and not share them with third parties."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Notify us immediately of any unauthorised use of your account."}]]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"4. Acceptable Use"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"You agree not to:"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Use the Service for any unlawful purpose or in violation of these Terms."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Attempt to reverse-engineer, scrape, or extract data from the Service without permission."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Submit false, misleading, or harmful content through the Service."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Impersonate any person or entity or misrepresent your affiliation with any person or entity."}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Use the Service in any way that could damage, disable, or impair it."}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"5. Subscription and Payment"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"MealCoreAI offers both free and paid subscription tiers. Paid subscriptions are billed on the cycle stated at the time of purchase (monthly or annual). By subscribing:"}],["$","ul",null,{"chil